    "note": [
      "28 admitted, 0 exposed, 0 reviewed. The gap between the first two numbers is deliberate and is the",
      "containment: an API caller can build a three-party deed today and get a correct one, and no user is",
      "invited to do so by a form until somebody has said the family is ready.",
      "",
      "Four families carry a statutory note because the statute plainly contemplates more than two principals.",
      "That is NOT legal support for the family: the statute permitting three partners says nothing about",
      "whether this deed's clauses have been classified for three. Statutory permissibility and instrument",
      "readiness are different questions, and conflating them is the same error as conflating admission with",
      "exposure, one level up."
    ]
